  "label": "User projected onto the text message as the target of the threat",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'this is why we shoot you guys', where 'you guys' directly addresses the viewer/user as the implied target of the violent threat. The meme uses this deictic pronoun to create an immediate and personal sense of danger, making the user feel targeted by the police officer's implied justification for lethal force.",
